WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.990
Well, well, well.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:10.960
You pushed us to the sidelines after all that boasting about defeating the Precures, and yet, here we are.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.280
I wonder, how <i>will</i> you report this to King Selfish?

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.370
We can defeat the Precures whenever we choose.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:19.800
That's right.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.140
We've just been warmin' up so they don't give us cramps.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.540
We'll show you what happens when we get serious!

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.020
Are you all right?

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.220
He's sleeping?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.050
The gears are already in motion...

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:47.420
for our ultimate plan to destroy the world!

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:49.040
{OP}

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:00.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.610
Every day it sparkles

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.280
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:13.200
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:18.860
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:24.500
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:29.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:35.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:44.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.180
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:51.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:58.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:04.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:10.040
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.190
Anyone there?

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:17.930
It's not a door.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:18.850
Hello?

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.220
And it's not a phone.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:25.530
The mirror that reflects any truth, Magical Lovely Pad.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:30.070
This Sacred Treasure holds the same power as the princess's spear, and if we can master it,

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:32.370
we should be able to purify King Selfish.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.320
But how do we even use it?

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.470
It's a mirror, but it doesn't reflect anything.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.210
Then let us analyze it!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:51.820
Unfortunately, modern science is unable to fully analyze this object.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.860
Shall we test its heat resistance at 1000 degrees Celsius?

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.060
Or perhaps its stress resistance at the ocean floor?

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:58.950
I-I have a better idea!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:02:59.900
Ai!

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.620
Not even Kyupirappa worked?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.070
We've finally obtained the power to oppose King Selfish,

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.020
and yet we're unable to use it...

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.280
Hey, anyone hungry?

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.790
Crisis in Oogai City!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.790
Crisis in Oogai City!

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.530
I'm back!

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:32.490
Hello.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.100
Oh, Rikka.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.400
Mommy! What happened to work?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.370
I'm on break.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.940
I just had a craving for some omelette rice!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.620
C'mon, Aguri, come in!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.110
But with our situation, I've no will to eat...

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:52.630
There is still so much we lack in strength...

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.200
You can't fight on an empty stomach, you know.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.180
But...

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.020
Oh, Aguri!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.110
Grandmother! Why are you here?

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.030
Just a notice for the next tea ceremony.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.060
Sorry for making you come out here.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:04.750
Here.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.190
Thank you.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:09.440
Perhaps I should have some omelette rice as well.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.860
May I join you all?

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.350
Of course!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.090
Grandpa, Daddy!

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.940
Make us some yummy omelette rice!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.100
Okay!

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.580
Now you come in too, Aguri!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:22.630
Ah...

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.780
You simply must join us as well, Sebastian.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.180
If you so insist.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:29.030
Mommy, can I sit next to you?

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.330
Oh, of course.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.110
I'm starving!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.830
On to our next story.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:42.300
A strange phenomenon is occurring in Oogai City.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:47.240
Previously healthy people are suddenly collapsing and falling asleep.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:51.570
We don't know the cause, but the number of people afflicted is slowly increasing.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.840
What could that be about?

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:02.400
Ai, what's wrong?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.180
Oh no!

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.640
People are falling asleep before our very eyes!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:11.970
Something's happened to our field reporters.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.930
What could this be?

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.170
What happened?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.450
Mommy! Are you okay?

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.610
She's asleep!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.270
Mana's grandpa!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.550
They're not waking up.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.500
Mommy!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.440
Grandmother!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.860
Wake up!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.260
Those dark objects are...

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.540
Sebastian!

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:44.530
Watch out!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:47.760
Mana!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:52.830
Was that...

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.900
The Lovies protected you!

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:03.110
Come and get me, Precures!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:15.030
This is our final measure to destroy the world.

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:22.580
The Selfish Plant we raised produces immeasurable amounts of Selfish Seeds!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.900
Those seeds rain and scatter from the skies,

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.420
embedding themselves into the psyches of everyone in town!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:33.180
For now, those humans can do nothing but sleep!

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:37.810
But when those seeds bud, everyone's psyche shall be enveloped in darkness!

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:39.880
Selfish!

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:43.570
Imagine, tens of thousands of Selfishes going berserk!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:49.100
And those human-turned-Selfishes will bring about the end of their own world with their own hands!

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.160
But that's not all! {Wow, where were the plans like this when I was falling asleep and waiting for the show to get interesting?}

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:58.400
The sudden burst of new Egogy will immediately resurrect King Selfish! {Wow, where were the plans like this when I was falling asleep and waiting for the show to get interesting?}

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:01.390
And it won't be long before those seeds bud.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.670
The world is as good as destroyed!

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:06.860
There is but one way to stop it...

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:09.290
and that is to defeat us!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.340
But of course...

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.920
you girls...

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.880
Have no chance of defeating us!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.150
Well...

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.350
we'll never know unless we try!

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.130
Charles!

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.190
Precure Love Link!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:26.180
L-O-V-E!

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:26.950
L-O-V-E!

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:27.650
L-O-V-E!

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:28.720
L-O-V-E!

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.440
Wait.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.660
You have a five minute time limit.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:39.510
Let us get this fight started!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:41.680
I understand!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.460
Ladies and gentlemen! {Rachel and Lance are gentlemen, so I can use this.}

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.200
This is our true power!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.000
They combined!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.820
Now, let's begin! {#RIP Yotsuba's car nevar 4get}

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:19.340
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:24.530
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:31.830
Let's combine our strength!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:40.900
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:54.390
Now it's our turn!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:56.140
Here we go!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.520
Precure Dress Up!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.520
Kyupirappa!

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:26.830
Cure Ace!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.480
Let us end this at once!

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.170
Beautify!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.750
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.630
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.240
Ace Shot!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.660
Bang!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.970
Where's the Lovely Pad?

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:17.470
Oh, do you mean this Sacred Treasure?

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.380
Sacred Treasure?

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:22.500
It's what those legendary warriors used.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:25.980
What'll happen when I do <i>this</i>?

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:45.230
The... Lovely Pad...

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.740
And with that, this fight is over!

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:10.550
Oh?

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:16.220
What good do you think that junk'll do ya?

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:18.430
It's not junk.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:19.700
It may be broken,

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:23.100
but it still holds Melan's feelings.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.810
It's a treasure!

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.550
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:34.610
A Precure must always hold her head high and persevere!

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:39.250
Even without the Lovely Pad, we shall never lose to the likes of you!

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:04.960
The Selfish Seeds will bud at any moment.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:07.510
We'll wait until then to strike the final blow!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:13.040
We wouldn't want you to miss the end of the world, after all!

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.010
Not one of our attacks worked...

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.780
There's nothing left we can do...

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:30.460
I'm sorry, Sword...

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:33.630
I'm sorry, Charles...

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.110
I...

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:39.840
I...

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:44.780
I thought I understood how you all felt about losing Trump Kingdom...

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.550
But I didn't understand a thing.

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:56.560
After having it happen to the people around me and the city I live in, I finally understand.

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:00.730
It makes your heart sting so much...

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:04.370
It's just too sad!

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.440
I can't stand it!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.960
Cry harder, wail louder!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.930
After all, when the world ends, you're going with it!

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:21.650
Welp, that was a good cry.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:22.880
I'm better now.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.630
I'm done being sad.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.280
Now, time to fight back!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.750
Fight back?

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:35.390
The Lovely Pad's broken, so we don't stand a chance as we are now.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:40.360
So let's just get waaaaaaay stronger than we are now!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:47.260
Aguri, you used your desire to protect the world to mature and become Cure Ace.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:52.840
If strong feelings can make us mature, then we can get stronger!

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:56.840
Can you truly strengthen yourselves right this instant?

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.950
We can!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:58.810
I know it!

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:02.480
After all, we want to save everyone!

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:05.030
Those feelings won't lose to the Selfishes!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.490
Besides...

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.090
I'm not alone!

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.320
Really now.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.390
You're always asking the impossible,

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.510
but you're really pushing it now!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:18.110
But Heart is exactly right.

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:21.630
However strong our foes may be, our feelings shall never lose!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.970
If we're all together, we can do it!

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:26.440
Melan's with us, too...

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.250
The feelings she held while waiting ten thousand years for us...

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.180
deserve a good answer!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.860
Leva said this was their final plan.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:40.870
That means they're at the end of their rope as well.

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.460
Let's beat them down with everything we've got!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.370
There's nothing to fear if we're together!

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.800
We won't let this world meet Trump Kingdom's fate!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.190
Cure Heart...

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:57.840
I never thought you would be the one to teach me.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:58.610
You have...

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:03.970
No, you all have risen to a new stage of Precure!

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:07.820
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:08.960
First!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:12.790
A Precure must always hold her head high and persevere!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.840
Second! {hahahahahahaha fuck everything I'm finally doing this}

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.460
Love is meant to be given!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:16.380
Third!

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:18.260
To love is to defend one another!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:19.330
Fourth!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.980
A Precure must trust herself and never regret her actions!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:22.620
Fifth!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.700
A Precure must be a first class lady!

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.400
Sixth!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.760
There's a sixth?!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.470
If we work together,

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.450
anything is possible!

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:36.480
Girls, let's go!

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.570
Yeah!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:41.590
Stop right there!

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.420
This is our world...

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:47.250
and we're gonna protect it!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.970
You simply don't know when to quit.

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:52.460
Then we'll get rid of you all at once!

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:58.540
Even if you're strong enough to destroy the world,

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.400
there are some things you can never erase!

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:04.370
Our determination to protect others will never die!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.030
I'll blow away...

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:07.340
every last bit...

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:08.810
of your foolish feelings!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:09.910
We won't let you!

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:16.080
We'll protect our city and Melan's feelings!

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:20.990
However strong you may be, we won't give in!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.630
As long as our hearts still beat within our chests...

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:27.820
As long as I can feel my heart race,

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:28.900
we will never...

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.010
Give up!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:39.770
The Lovely Pad?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.860
I can feel a tremendous power...

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.050
Did it...

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:55.440
The Lovely Pad responded to our heartbeats!

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:12.490
Lovely Pad, you have my thanks.

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:17.220
Brimming with love,

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.270
Cure Heart!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:23.880
The light of wisdom,

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:26.300
Cure Diamond!

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:30.690
The warmth of the sun,

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.090
Cure Rosetta!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.140
The blade of courage,

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.250
Cure Sword!

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.230
Love's trump card,

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:44.770
Cure Ace!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:50.240
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.890
Dokidoki Precure!

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:58.860
We shall make this town's heart race once more!

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:01.410
Kyupirappa!

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:05.830
We already said...

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.900
that you don't stand a chance!

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.120
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:43.000
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.570
Sorry for the wait.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.400
It looks yummy!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.410
Aguri, is something wrong?

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:28.140
I'm eating a meal with everyone.

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:30.850
I'm just happy that I can.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:33.020
Me too.

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.310
I always took it for granted...

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:39.290
but there's nothing happier than this!

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.890
All right, save the talking for later!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.430
Eat it while it's hot!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.120
Don't mind if we do!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.710
That Magical Lovely Pad...

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.110
What fearsome power...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.800
Blasted Precures...

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:04.720
Next time—

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:07.120
Unfortunately, there won't <i>be</i> a next time.

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:14.720
Bel...

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:16.360
What are you...

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:21.300
I'm helping myself to the source of our power, Egogy.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:27.970
Sadly, your battle with the Precures has left you <i>gravely</i> exhausted.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:32.130
You don't even have enough strength left to resist.

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:33.170
Curse you!

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:36.640
I never thought you intended this from the start—

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.550
Bel!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:48.540
Your services are no longer required.

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:51.120
Now pack up your belongings.

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:57.270
<i>I'll</i> finish the job for you.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:04.490
{ED}

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:08.630
Wait, Mana, are you okay?

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:10.640
No, I'm not...

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.910
She has a fever, likely due to exhaustion.

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:17.430
The cultural festival is near, so she's been busier than usual...

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:18.650
But what do we do?!

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:21.220
We can't prepare for the festival without Mana!

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:22.940
Allow me to help!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.420
I'll work everyone in your school to the bone in Mana's stead!

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:28.860
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.560
Mana's Out of Commission!

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.560
Mana's Out of Commission!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:33.560
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
